rosiCalculationExplanation:
ROSI calculation:
• Current ALE: {currentAle}
• Residual ALE: {residualAle}
• Risk reduction: {riskReduction}
• Treatment cost: {treatmentCost}
• Net benefit: {netBenefit}
• ROSI = Net benefit ÷ Treatment cost = {rosi}

Formula: ROSI = (Current ALE − Residual ALE − Treatment cost) ÷ Treatment cost
